e underlined sentence be placed?","”"]}],["$","li","Which sentence best concludes the paragraph?",{"className":"rounded-lg bg-eng-navy-50 p-3 text-sm italic leading-relaxed text-eng-navy-700","children":["“","Which sentence best concludes the paragraph?","”"]}],["$","li","Which revision best combines these sentences?",{"className":"rounded-lg bg-eng-navy-50 p-3 text-sm italic leading-relaxed text-eng-navy-700","children":["“","Which revision best combines these sentences?","”"]}]]}],["$","h4",null,{"className":"mb-2 mt-5 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-eng-gold-700","children":"The trap"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"rounded-lg bg-eng-gold-50 p-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-eng-navy-700","children":"Picking the truest statement rather than the one that does the job asked. A supporting-detail question is not asking which fact is most accurate; it is asking which fact supports this particular claim."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h4",null,{"className":"mb-2 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-eng-teal-700","children":"What to do"}],["$","ol",null,{"className":"space-y-2","children":[["$","li","For a topic sentence, find what every other sentence has in common, then pick the choice that covers all of them and nothing more.",{"className":"flex gap-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-eng-navy-700","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-bold text-eng-teal-700","aria-hidden":"true","children":[1,"."]}],["$","span",null,{"children":"For a topic sentence, find what every other sentence has in common, then pick the choice that covers all of them and nothing more."}]]}],["$","li","For supporting detail, restate the claim in your own words first. Then test each choice against that claim, not against the topic generally.",{"className":"flex gap-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-eng-navy-700","children":["$L3a","$L3b"]}],"$L3c","$L3d","$L3e"]}]]}]]}],"$L3f"]}]
